  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS 3.0 or later, 68020 or later",
    "MUI 3.8 or later with NList 0.89, NListtree 18.8 and SpeedBar 1.3 or later",
    "xadmaster.library 10 or later",
    "Optional xvs.library 33 or later for virus checks, OpenURL 3 or later and xadclients documentation 1.3 or later"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The executable, readme, history and all 20 toolbar images including CheckVirus match the Aminet archive.",
    "Checked BCWB inputs preserve seven Workbench icons and five saved files in ENVARC:Voodoo-X and ENVARC:mui. The main tool icon uses a 16000-byte stack, and the readme and history are MultiView projects.",
    "The saved settings enable automatic virus checking and external XAD clients. The stock toolbar refers to Images relative to the application drawer. The manual virus check is a menu action.",
    "The catalogue entries for xadmaster, MUI, OpenURL and xvs own the shared runtime dependencies."
  ],
